  <item>
    <title>09.如果说爱就是分享欲的话，那只要来信，就是我爱你。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6291b96183ddae2d9e72ac2b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6291b96183ddae2d9e72ac2b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 28 May 2022 05:55:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FgGF5m9W4o3HM5HVUJPaRSxrsbd9.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>春天的前情回顾</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">3:47</a> </span><strong><span>01｜摘香椿</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 时间地抬头让人眩晕，看着那么高大的树，我变得无比渺小，周围的一切都一下子回到了20年前的一个夏天，那一刻我害怕时间，我怕天一黑，阳光一落下，我就又长大了。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">07:05</a> 用望远镜在马路牙子上静静地看了几分钟月亮。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 02｜</span><strong><span>杨宁老师的美学理论课</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>指路：</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/70351856/channel/collectiondetail?sid=95143&amp;ctype=0" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/70351856/channel/collectiondetail?sid=95143&amp;ctype=0"><span>杨宁老师的哔哩哔哩首页链接</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="942">15:42</a> 做饭这件事儿里有一个动作是我喜欢的，就是为了掌握火候儿，你得翻面儿。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="974">16:14</a> 03｜错峰看《人世间》</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1138">18:58</a> 如果说爱就是分享欲的话，那只要来信，就是我爱你。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1172">19:32</a> 04｜重新迷恋了一段时间姜文</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1316">21:56</a> 姜文说「对」</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Dr MATT MORGAN ：“有时黑暗能带你看到光明。”</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhGmAaSIdvAGDld9XI6yWfChs-ds.m4a" length="57193903" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L2x1Qno0OE45aDJqQ3c0SlBST2l0dVdaNGhWS0wucG5n.png"/>
