  <item>
    <title>08.身体本身就是能量守恒定律的最忠实用户</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62400e14d485a5cd7767fb21</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62400e14d485a5cd7767fb21</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Mar 2022 07:11:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FmdcdKDmkz4ai3PTZiVk3ww3iqyo.png"></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">02:07</a> 一场神奇的交通事故：肇事者想离开，我们喊住肇事者却发现那是两位聋哑人；聋哑人很强硬，我也是第一次签事故认定书。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 对方的眼神像刀子，我注意到了，但也明白那其实是自我保护，像口罩。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">09:44</a> 春分这天我把生鸡蛋立起来了三次，不得不说，我真是在自己体内把唯物和唯心互补的很好的人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a></span><a href="http://s.weibo.com/weibo?q=%23%E6%8C%91%E6%88%98%E6%AF%8F%E5%A4%A9%E7%9C%8B%E4%B8%80%E9%9B%86%E3%80%8A%E4%BA%BA%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%96%E3%80%8B%E4%B8%8D%E5%93%AD%23" data-url="http://s.weibo.com/weibo?q=%23%E6%8C%91%E6%88%98%E6%AF%8F%E5%A4%A9%E7%9C%8B%E4%B8%80%E9%9B%86%E3%80%8A%E4%BA%BA%E9%97%B4%E4%B8%96%E3%80%8B%E4%B8%8D%E5%93%AD%23"><span> #挑战每天看一集《人间世》不哭#</span></a><span> 欢迎大家来玩！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 分享一件正经事：痛哭。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 我以为对《告别》脱敏了，可是……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 希望我的心创造出茧房。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llSOAgrmH9WtQrSIlnPJsokx4Lp_.m4a" length="42225082" type="audio/mp4"/>
