  <item>
    <title>06.关于一份工作让我的Mbti，从i变成了e这件事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6224d2a70e153c60474c797e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6224d2a70e153c60474c797e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Mar 2022 15:26:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>⏳</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FnGHjzWLA4r3H9YkfY46sonC9Le2.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>开始工作之后，mbti从infp逐渐变成了enfp！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>这一期是在车里录的音，终于捕捉到了一些最初喜欢音频节目的缘故。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期↓</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13">00:13</a></span></strong><span> 888音乐专场预告，正片在这：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62262edb6c19cc13383d7b9c?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTZkZTQ0ZTBmNWU3MjNiYjVlNTliYyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62262edb6c19cc13383d7b9c?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTZkZTQ0ZTBmNWU3MjNiYjVlNTliYyJ9"><span>《The Great Women |妇女节特别企划》</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a></span></strong><span> 感受到自己在逐渐的摆脱一些身上源于懒惰而拥有的快乐，这样来的快乐不要也罢！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a></span></strong><span> 希望我能给平日里忙碌没有时间思考的朋友提供一个选题大方向。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a></span></strong><span> MBTI测试下我的变化</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">12:34</a></span></strong><span> 我的多重人格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> “在屋顶看太阳落下是自由，在没有限制的狂风暴雨里打滚儿也是。”——从人格聊到《肖申克的救赎》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> </span><strong><span>如果给我个机会给那时候的自己写一封信，我还是会不告诉她对她来说更精彩的世界，因为对那个时候的她来说，探索本身确实更有魅力。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a> </span></strong><span>肖申克的救赎是我每年会看一次到两次的电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 喜欢希望，平和，稳定。</span></p><span></span><p><span>⌛️</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lo5mli8qpeSZC96GK4TcJjVyuuIf.m4a" length="54390589" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:28:17</itunes:duration>
