  <item>
    <title>05.获得能量的方法里爱是来源，听巴赫也不错</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/621a5a3342107d36fefdfaae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">621a5a3342107d36fefdfaae</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 26 Feb 2022 21:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期音乐写在前面，都是巴赫的作品。听巴赫的时候，什么都没什么。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FqSgdPnB3Y7CkExU5yIBW9fezUOu.png"></figure><span></span><h2><strong><span>It's Time to ⬇</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>One</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a> #录音前的一分钟# </span></strong><span>我在想：</span><strong><span>#最近吃的最多的一餐#</span></strong><span> 这part可能要消失了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 最喜欢的作家加西亚·马尔克斯写过一句话，在自传《活着为了讲述》中他描写童年的片段里他写道：‘从一岁起，孩子就被大人从厨房阳台直接扔下水，先套上游泳圈，让他们不怕水；再去掉游泳圈，让他们不怕死。’</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Two</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 成长，代价真的大。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="344">05:44</a> 爱你的人，用生命教你成长。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Three</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 紧绷的120分钟。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a>我在与这些文字，这些文字构成的逻辑，这些逻辑背后缺少的一环相互交流与填充。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;而纸和笔尖是我们之间沟通的媒介，虽然考场是安静的，但又似乎每一句都掷地有声。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a> 我在获取能量，在和试卷的交流里。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Four</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="515">08:35</a></span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>《人类：一种也没什么特别的动物》</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FkVQCfKytvZ77Wkt-60cDoIFVnDa.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>学科定义变得漂亮起来，是因为他们是一切之间的故事。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 吃饱还是人类最棘手事情。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Five</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 雄狮也是渣男啊！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Six</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">16:24</a> 原来直到耄耋，人也依然会面对到底是居家养老，还是住进养老院这样是否选择再次社会化的难题。</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luRhPhJ1Hl0RJv9KvxQW2pKcsuLQ.m4a" length="30493359" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:16:59</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L2xrY3JubnFYRHk0TWcyUEpVVGtrbzlrak12MjUucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>5</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
