  <item>
    <title>04.拍了一部短片 影片的中文名是《天敌》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6211301742107d36fefdf806</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6211301742107d36fefdf806</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Feb 2022 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>第四集了，这周，聊了和动物之间的故事。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>#录音前的一分钟#</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a>在回味电影，今天自己去看了《尼罗河上的惨案》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a>影院的放映机如果坏了，也许可以进VIP厅</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>#最近吃的最多的一餐#</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>没有！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>#看了万物生灵后，我也来讲讲和动物之间的故事#</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 几个丢人的故事</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="382">06:22</a>唯物主义和唯心主义在互补</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">06:52</a> 我给小狗写了一部电影短片，关于……</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a>我给狗读《围城》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">09:18</a>我给影片起了名字，叫《天敌》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>“</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fj67qAxB8shrheo9Q9sZIRXzkrb_.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FkCwdGs7bXpyXmVu651GPJLxtD5I.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>”</span></p><span></span><p><span>( Hey 有点想你 ）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a>猫对我的信任让我们可以搂搂抱抱了</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a>两只小猫竟然都很像我</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a>我和小猫加强了一些自洽的功力</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期提及｜</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>“心有猛虎，细嗅蔷薇”</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>"In me the tiger sniffs the rose."</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span>是出自英国诗人西格里夫·萨松的《于我，过去，现在以及未来》中的经典诗句，诗人余光中将其翻译为</span><em><strong><span>“心有猛虎，细嗅蔷薇”。</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期音乐｜</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://i.y.qq.com/v8/playsong.html?songid=279125040#webchat_redirect" data-url="https://i.y.qq.com/v8/playsong.html?songid=279125040#webchat_redirect"><span>All Creatures Great &amp; Small</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://i.y.qq.com/v8/playsong.html?songid=279125037#webchat_redirect" data-url="https://i.y.qq.com/v8/playsong.html?songid=279125037#webchat_redirect"><span>The Wrong Cat</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://i.y.qq.com/v8/playsong.html?songid=279125066#webchat_redirect" data-url="https://i.y.qq.com/v8/playsong.html?songid=279125066#webchat_redirect"><span>Turning Pages</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://i.y.qq.com/v8/playsong.html?songid=279125065#webchat_redirect" data-url="https://i.y.qq.com/v8/playsong.html?songid=279125065#webchat_redirect"><span>You've got to Dream</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://i.y.qq.com/v8/playsong.html?songid=279125042#webchat_redirect" data-url="https://i.y.qq.com/v8/playsong.html?songid=279125042#webchat_redirect"><span>On That We Must Agree</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liZMdGyxQeUXfcxXHwTcEc1f2-VM.m4a" length="28012769" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:15:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L2xqYVUwUTV0Vkc1RXpPOVl0RW1HZE13UllsclMucG5n.png"/>
