  <item>
    <title>03.跑！一份《亲自获得快乐指南》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6207d31ee323a9bc533abdf5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6207d31ee323a9bc533abdf5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 12 Feb 2022 21:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如果获得快乐就这么简单，你愿不愿意试一试。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FmLqVDQbVPazWjHXKoYnHIq6sLK8.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>#一分钟前我在想#：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a>我的拖更没有理由了。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>#吃的最多的一餐（天）#：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a>吃饭对我来说是消耗。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>#今天想聊聊「奔跑、运动、等泛健康生活方式」#</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a></span></strong><span>我真的五点半起床</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a>日出的那个瞬间太美了，他像是在奖励小孩。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">06:01</a>身体浸泡在快乐里，再不容易也容易多了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a>享受其中。肌肉的到来并不是入侵，反而随之而来的多巴胺内啡肽HGH让我获得了更多的快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐｜</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=1400175732&amp;userid=312843326" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=1400175732&amp;userid=312843326"><span>10000 Hours</span></a><span>- Thomas Vee</span></p><span></span><p><span>&lt;热评第一条&gt;：“一万小时定律，就是不管你做什么事情，只要坚持一万小时，基本上都可以成为该领域的专家。”</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=1823889594&amp;userid=312843326" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=1823889594&amp;userid=312843326"><span>If It's Not You It's Not Anyone</span></a><span>-Thomas Vee</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luVyJfPfAPAs0PX3G4AMkESGVVFm.m4a" length="23413210" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:12:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L2xxdm9TYS1hOEhETXQ0SkowNDZHcEVfT3ZwTTcucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>3</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>02.官方回应一次“催婚”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61fe1a4f0c35c9f95dca175a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61fe1a4f0c35c9f95dca175a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 05 Feb 2022 06:33:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><br></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fq0m00lpykJZ8TMNx3ySpP3ZyC4b.png"></figure><span></span><h2><span>立春那天录音，所以声音里全部都是祝大家春天能快乐。趁着过年，回应那些催婚的亲朋好友。</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>#一分钟前我在想#：</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a>我的耳机到底去哪里了？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a>去年立春我写《我的社会性别是流动的》</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><span>#吃的最多的一餐#：</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a></span><strong><span>味蕾能帮你记住很多，不用害怕大脑当中的任何神经元出问题。</span></strong></h2><span></span><h2><span>#今天想聊聊「爱情」#</span></h2><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a>她觉得爱情就是全世界的审美为你发生颠覆和改变。（不得不说，这个点卡的有些浪漫</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="333">05:33</a>我一直以来都认为爱情/谈恋爱/性/结婚/生小孩不是五个阶段而是五件不同的事。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a>亲密关系要基于对等，因为如果真的有一架天平的话，获得平衡点一定是因为AB双方之间有空隙，紧紧贴在一起是很难找到平衡的。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">07:48</a>结婚是一件我认为不那么严肃的事情，因为觉得人生还不至于出现这么一步错后患无穷的事情，就没必要太紧张。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="516">08:36</a>还没结婚，就想到离婚了。期待这次冒险。我在想，这会不会是让感情变好的一个途径。我始终相信退一步就是进一步。我知道这是冒险。但这个险值得冒，至少比“先结吧不行再离”这个险值得。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="627">10:27</a>关于理想型这件事，我喜欢大叔。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="937">15:37</a>Anyway，爱情的前提是爱自己。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>专辑</span><a href="https://music.apple.com/cn/album/%E9%BB%91%E8%89%B2%E6%9F%B3%E4%B8%81/914664926?l=en" data-url="https://music.apple.com/cn/album/%E9%BB%91%E8%89%B2%E6%9F%B3%E4%B8%81/914664926?l=en"><span>《黑色柳丁》</span></a><span>——陶喆</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://music.apple.com/cn/album/22/914664926?i=914664943&amp;l=en" data-url="https://music.apple.com/cn/album/22/914664926?i=914664943&amp;l=en"><span>22</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://music.apple.com/cn/album/katrina/914664926?i=914664946&amp;l=en" data-url="https://music.apple.com/cn/album/katrina/914664926?i=914664946&amp;l=en"><span>Katrina</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/likSKW8FX2oYQAhg7TBW5RbpL342.m4a" length="31327987" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:16:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZtbUJ1LXZLc3RzNzJncmlqV3RveTR6dHpOdGUucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>2</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>01.节目意义：跟自己聊天比较不会冷场</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61fb97740c35c9f95dca16ed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61fb97740c35c9f95dca16ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 03 Feb 2022 08:50:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>唉，老节目不更新，新节目先预告。</span></strong></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FvmIIrYDw30Ujo11rleOibRZFdt9.png"></figure><span></span><h2><span>大家好，这是</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60a32993c865646fd16595cf?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTZkZTQ0ZTBmNWU3MjNiYjVlNTliYyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60a32993c865646fd16595cf?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTZkZTQ0ZTBmNWU3MjNiYjVlNTliYyJ9"><span>「日落电波」</span></a><span>的自我衍生友台「<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">5:30</a>FM」。本期预告你将听到：</span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Q：“为什么叫这个名字？”</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>A</span></strong><span>：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a>这个名字很简单，意思是我通常五点半会起床，这段时间会相对比较自由，会慢下来做很多事情，也会慢慢的进入思考状态。在这档节目里你将听到我完全的单口，针对不同问题，或许是当下最热门，或许是最近看的书，或许是最近关注的内容分享一些我的观点，或是我看到的听到的别人的观点。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Q：“有什么愿望？”</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>A</span></strong><span>：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a>我的想法又恰好与你相碰撞到，那就是最幸福不过的事情了。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Q：“节目的固定板块？”</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>A</span></strong><span>：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a>我分出几个板块，分别是‘开始录音前的一分钟我在想/做什么？’、‘过去的一周里吃的最多的一餐是什么’以及‘正式的思考环节’。</span></blockquote><span></span><h2><span>散步的时候自言自语也算是一种聊天，自己和自己聊天也还挺好的，甚至还有问有答，反而不会冷场。</span></h2><span></span><p><span>本期音乐｜</span><a href="https://music.apple.com/cn/album/eason/1568822309?i=1568822310&amp;l=en" data-url="https://music.apple.com/cn/album/eason/1568822309?i=1568822310&amp;l=en"><span>Eason—Davis John Patton</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/Fi22i9guTocVIxw73106lBLpbEvs.m4a" length="2240323" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:02:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZzOXE1U1pub2ZWMGZITTA5WFc0dEJsWkJCRi0ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>1</itunes:episode>
